@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra trang thai API -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC241200004",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/phamlongvuTN/EduSubmit-DTC241200004"
}

### 4. Nop bai khong hop le (thieu studentCode) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/phamlongvuTN/EduSubmit-DTC241200004"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop ton tai -> 200 OK (thay id bang id thuc te khi nop)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6. Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
